WEBVTT

00:01.230 --> 00:02.830
It's...

00:02.830 --> 00:04.460
It's you...

00:05.030 --> 00:06.660
Noah!

00:07.270 --> 00:09.100
Noah, it is you, isn't it?!

00:09.100 --> 00:11.400
Yeah, it is indeed.

00:13.010 --> 00:15.480
I have been ordered to administer your
punishment here and now.

00:30.830 --> 00:38.570
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

00:38.570 --> 00:45.530
Towards a far, faraway place

00:58.890 --> 01:05.090
Blown by the wind, we walk on

01:05.090 --> 01:12.060
Wanting to know the reason we were born

01:12.270 --> 01:18.570
Even if a time of loss should come

01:18.570 --> 01:25.710
Let's now choose to hold each other tight

01:28.150 --> 01:35.560
We've all surely got our arms outstretched

01:35.560 --> 01:41.530
Towards something we can't lose

01:41.530 --> 01:49.170
Pulling only brilliant dreams closer

01:49.170 --> 01:56.040
Towards a far, faraway place

02:16.930 --> 02:21.700
Episode 21
Irrepressible Feelings

02:32.480 --> 02:34.110
It's...

02:37.720 --> 02:40.350
...proof that I'm a Tuskan.

02:42.020 --> 02:44.230
Why am I...

02:44.230 --> 02:45.850
Why?

03:09.120 --> 03:12.420
You're moving at a rather sluggish pace
this morning, aren't you?

03:15.260 --> 03:18.890
Well, now, have you had a fight
with Zed or something?

03:24.800 --> 03:26.430
Master Zico!

03:28.400 --> 03:31.700
My parents, could they have been...

03:35.580 --> 03:38.080
Uh, never mind...

03:38.080 --> 03:40.050
It's nothing.

03:41.920 --> 03:44.040
Okay, let's eat!

03:50.020 --> 03:54.160
I'm going to give it my all at the
Juniors Tournament coming up!

03:54.160 --> 03:56.660
I'll give it my all and win!

03:56.660 --> 03:59.900
Well, as long as you enjoy yourself,
that's what counts.

03:59.900 --> 04:01.530
Yes, sir!

04:03.140 --> 04:04.410
Master Zico!

04:04.410 --> 04:06.040
What is it?

04:06.040 --> 04:09.080
You mustn't leave your broccoli.

04:09.080 --> 04:11.050
I know that, girl!

04:15.220 --> 04:18.990
Good work in escorting the escaped prisoner.

04:18.990 --> 04:23.160
You did a great job accomplishing your mission,
despite the accident.

04:23.160 --> 04:24.460
My thanks.

04:24.460 --> 04:26.790
I don't care about that.

04:26.790 --> 04:28.200
So, what about it?

04:28.200 --> 04:30.670
Are you going to let me go to Neotopia?

04:30.670 --> 04:33.630
Zed, will you not mind your tongue?

04:35.000 --> 04:37.210
You don't change, do you?

04:37.210 --> 04:41.240
Neotopia also appreciates your
efforts in this matter greatly,

04:41.240 --> 04:44.150
and they have expressed an interest
in inviting you there.

04:44.150 --> 04:47.120
Really? Then it's no problem!

04:47.120 --> 04:48.820
Hurry and let me go over there!

04:48.820 --> 04:50.520
Now, calm down!

04:50.520 --> 04:54.160
It will still take some time to go through
all the formal proceedings.

04:54.160 --> 04:56.090
What do you mean, "proceedings"?

04:56.090 --> 04:58.190
I just want to see Noah!

04:58.190 --> 05:00.660
Given the circumstances we're dealing with,

05:00.660 --> 05:02.660
we cannot proceed as simply as that.

05:02.660 --> 05:05.870
Do not go off and act on your own, Zed.

05:05.870 --> 05:10.370
If you do, it will cause trouble for
your friend, Noah, as well.

05:10.370 --> 05:12.840
Jeez, all right.

05:24.450 --> 05:27.790
Guess who?

05:27.790 --> 05:30.260
What do you want, Roya?

05:31.960 --> 05:33.430
Practice?

05:33.430 --> 05:34.800
For what?

05:34.800 --> 05:36.560
For the Juniors Tournament.

05:36.560 --> 05:41.670
It's a competition that only teens
like you and me participate in.

05:41.670 --> 05:44.640
I guess you could call it sort of a "mini-Joust".

05:46.340 --> 05:49.280
What's with the totally unenthusiastic reaction?

05:49.280 --> 05:51.280
Where's my, "I'm going to win this thing"?

05:51.280 --> 05:53.880
Or like, "I'm the toughest!"

05:53.880 --> 05:55.650
Don't you have anything like that to say?

05:55.650 --> 05:57.280
Nope.

05:58.790 --> 05:59.920
Why not?!

05:59.920 --> 06:01.520
Beats me.

06:01.520 --> 06:03.650
That's no answer!

06:05.490 --> 06:09.120
Is simply becoming stronger enough?

06:10.570 --> 06:13.190
No, I don't think that's enough on its own.

06:14.770 --> 06:16.500
I feel like that's not it.

06:16.500 --> 06:18.300
"Strength" is...

06:20.640 --> 06:21.940
What the heck are you doing?!

06:21.940 --> 06:25.240
What's with you and the half-ass "cool guy" act?

06:26.710 --> 06:28.510
What is her problem?

06:31.120 --> 06:32.290
Oh, right.

06:32.290 --> 06:34.690
The Juniors Tournament is
coming up soon, huh?

06:34.690 --> 06:36.690
I totally forgot about it.

06:36.690 --> 06:37.830
Hey, c'mon!

06:37.830 --> 06:40.190
You won't be able to win a single
round with that attitude!

06:40.190 --> 06:42.130
You need to get doing some
intensive training right now!

06:42.130 --> 06:44.070
I'll join you.

06:44.070 --> 06:45.570
Sorry, Roya.

06:45.570 --> 06:49.170
I have to go back and bake some
bread for an order I got.

06:49.170 --> 06:50.940
Listen, Mickey.

06:50.940 --> 06:54.310
Don't you think you're forgetting
something important here?

06:54.310 --> 06:57.250
You're a shard caster!

06:57.250 --> 07:00.010
You won't do yourself any favors by
taking pleasure in baking!

07:00.010 --> 07:04.920
Your dream is to become a powerful
shard caster like your teacher, Dumas!

07:04.920 --> 07:05.920
Excuse me.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.260
Yes, what can I do for you?

07:07.260 --> 07:09.160
I'll take three of these, please.

07:09.160 --> 07:10.730
I appreciate your business.

07:10.730 --> 07:11.190
Thank you.

07:11.190 --> 07:12.230
Good grief...
Thank you.

07:12.230 --> 07:14.560
Completely ignore my advice, will he?

07:14.560 --> 07:16.360
You do whatever you like!

07:19.470 --> 07:21.440
Sheesh, first Zed, now Mickey!

07:21.440 --> 07:24.570
Are they taking shard casting seriously or what?

07:24.570 --> 07:28.530
If that's how it's going to be, then I swear
I'll become the champion!

07:33.710 --> 07:36.980
I'm not like Zed and Mickey.

07:36.980 --> 07:40.610
I want proof of my strength.

08:07.220 --> 08:12.950
What? King Hugh and Master Xeem
both came to this castle?

08:12.950 --> 08:14.390
Indeed they did!

08:14.390 --> 08:19.690
They seemed pleased with my reception
and left very delighted!

08:26.170 --> 08:27.870
Damn that Moloch,

08:27.870 --> 08:29.670
he's getting a big head!

08:39.150 --> 08:40.940
What's going on here?

08:41.850 --> 08:45.480
It has been a long time, Master Moloch.

08:45.990 --> 08:48.020
Ten years, I believe?

08:48.020 --> 08:50.560
Y..You're...

08:50.560 --> 08:53.230
...the seer Gerdieff!

08:53.230 --> 08:57.860
I have received a new vision, Moloch, my lord.

09:10.010 --> 09:13.450
The accursed child will return?!

09:13.450 --> 09:17.080
It... It can't be!

09:18.550 --> 09:22.180
Had we not finished her off?!

09:37.510 --> 09:40.040
Hear me, young shard casters!

09:40.040 --> 09:44.170
Here, today, we will be holding the
Joust Juniors Tournament.

09:45.210 --> 09:47.520
There's nothing to be afraid of.

09:47.520 --> 09:51.920
Fight away to your hearts' content
here before me, your idol.

09:51.920 --> 09:55.520
Let your passions seethe and surge!

09:55.520 --> 10:01.160
I shall be a willing audience to the swell
of your youthful hot-bloodedness!

10:03.300 --> 10:05.090
Master Robès!

10:07.470 --> 10:09.940
He's as big an idiot as ever.

10:14.880 --> 10:17.350
The first round, first match:

10:17.350 --> 10:19.680
Roya versus Zed!

10:19.680 --> 10:23.310
I never thought you'd be my
opponent in the first round.

10:24.050 --> 10:26.250
No holding back here.

10:26.250 --> 10:27.820
Right...

10:27.820 --> 10:29.450
Begin!

10:38.600 --> 10:40.030
Oh, my...

10:40.030 --> 10:41.800
The poor thing...

10:41.800 --> 10:45.430
All of a sudden, the difference in their
skills has grown quite vast.

10:50.880 --> 10:52.850
Here I come, Roya.

10:57.690 --> 10:59.320
What a hit!

10:59.320 --> 11:02.290
He's nothing like he was before!

11:02.290 --> 11:05.460
Zed's gone far beyond me.

11:05.460 --> 11:08.600
I've known he would for a long time.

11:08.600 --> 11:11.800
But even so, I must not lose this match!

11:11.800 --> 11:13.430
Apcarel!

11:26.510 --> 11:28.920
Doesn't he intend to use his spirits?

11:28.920 --> 11:30.880
Don't you underestimate me!

11:40.330 --> 11:43.200
Roya, what's the matter?

11:43.200 --> 11:45.700
What's going on? What happened?

11:45.700 --> 11:47.670
Oh, is she injured or something?

11:49.100 --> 11:50.900
Hey, are you all right?

11:52.340 --> 11:54.470
No! Don't touch me!

12:02.250 --> 12:04.050
Roya...

12:14.430 --> 12:16.060
I see...

12:16.630 --> 12:18.900
So, Roya withdrew then?

12:18.900 --> 12:20.170
Yeah...

12:20.170 --> 12:22.670
So, did you win?

12:22.670 --> 12:25.570
Nah, I quit too.

12:25.570 --> 12:27.110
Why?

12:27.110 --> 12:29.040
I never felt like doing it to begin with.

12:29.040 --> 12:32.170
It was just that Roya wouldn't
get off my case about it.

12:33.050 --> 12:34.050
Oh...

12:34.050 --> 12:35.350
Hey!

12:35.350 --> 12:37.520
Cut that out!

12:37.520 --> 12:38.650
C'mon, it's okay.

12:38.650 --> 12:40.860
Don't be so stingy with these.

12:40.860 --> 12:43.020
I'll help you make more when we go back.

12:43.020 --> 12:44.990
You'll burn them right to a crisp.

12:46.190 --> 12:46.860
See ya!

12:46.860 --> 12:48.330
Hey!
See ya!

13:01.280 --> 13:04.240
It's gotten a bit bigger.

13:14.660 --> 13:16.890
These are delicious, Roya.

13:16.890 --> 13:18.860
Care to try one?

13:20.490 --> 13:22.800
What's the matter?

13:22.800 --> 13:24.870
Master Zico...

13:24.870 --> 13:29.370
Were my parents really from Templar?

13:29.370 --> 13:30.940
Huh?

13:30.940 --> 13:34.240
They weren't from Tusk, were they?

13:35.710 --> 13:38.610
What kind of crazy talk is this?

13:38.610 --> 13:41.820
Of course they were from Templar.

13:41.820 --> 13:43.610
Then what is...

13:45.050 --> 13:47.020
What is...

13:52.590 --> 13:55.400
Never mind...

13:55.400 --> 13:57.190
Pardon me!

14:02.570 --> 14:06.370
So, the proof that she is Tuskan
has finally surfaced, has it?

14:06.910 --> 14:10.370
I will have to tell her the whole truth now.

14:17.550 --> 14:18.750
Huh?

14:18.750 --> 14:20.220
That's funny...

14:20.220 --> 14:23.020
Why can't I make them good, like Mickey?

14:24.760 --> 14:27.890
Maybe the burned ones are
tasty in their own way?

14:30.330 --> 14:31.960
Zed...

14:33.030 --> 14:34.660
Roya?

14:38.810 --> 14:41.100
I burned us another batch of breadcrumbs.

14:44.810 --> 14:46.780
Did something happen?

14:49.150 --> 14:54.520
There's something I'd like to talk to you about.

14:54.520 --> 14:56.320
Sure, what is it?

14:57.090 --> 15:00.360
Well, you see, I...

15:00.360 --> 15:01.960
Zed?

15:01.960 --> 15:04.100
Master Sebastian wants to see you.

15:04.100 --> 15:06.870
He says the formalities are out of the way
and that you can go anytime.

15:06.870 --> 15:08.000
Formalities?

15:08.000 --> 15:10.840
I don't really know what he's talking about,
so go see him yourself.

15:10.840 --> 15:13.810
Well, I'm in the middle of my deliveries,
so I got to run!

15:14.280 --> 15:16.110
Oh, I get it! It's about Neotopia!

15:16.110 --> 15:18.380
I can finally go to Neotopia!

15:18.380 --> 15:20.920
Sorry, Roya, we'll talk later!

15:20.920 --> 15:23.550
Wait! This is important!

15:23.550 --> 15:24.620
It's very important...

15:24.620 --> 15:27.420
Gotcha, we'll have a good talk later!

15:45.740 --> 15:47.370
Why?

15:49.510 --> 15:54.350
Why would the cursed child appear now?!

15:54.350 --> 15:58.090
And after I'd climbed so high at last!

15:58.090 --> 16:01.760
There is nothing for you to fear, Master Moloch.

16:01.760 --> 16:04.330
Gerdieff's predictions are for certain!

16:04.330 --> 16:07.630
You should know that better than anyone!

16:07.630 --> 16:08.800
Yes...

16:08.800 --> 16:13.130
That is why if she is still alive,

16:13.130 --> 16:18.440
if she returns, all we need do is
finish her off once again.

16:19.910 --> 16:24.650
Des... Despara!

16:24.650 --> 16:25.980
Despara!

16:25.980 --> 16:27.750
I'm begging you!

16:27.750 --> 16:30.880
Leave this to me, Master Moloch.

16:36.820 --> 16:38.560
I see...

16:38.560 --> 16:41.400
So, Moloch said that?

16:41.400 --> 16:43.400
Yes...

16:43.400 --> 16:47.100
She will return here then.

16:47.100 --> 16:51.410
This time I will be able to protect her.

16:51.410 --> 16:53.700
After all, that is why my soul remains here.

16:55.940 --> 16:57.570
Jesara...

16:58.510 --> 17:00.140
Cloud...

17:36.550 --> 17:39.850
Where should I go?

17:41.390 --> 17:46.690
In the end, none of them cares about
someone who's not kin.

17:54.540 --> 17:56.240
There...

17:56.240 --> 17:59.570
That is a very effective charm.

17:59.570 --> 18:00.870
It's okay.

18:00.870 --> 18:03.000
You'll be better in no time.

18:05.650 --> 18:07.440
Mother...

18:13.250 --> 18:15.220
It was the same then!

18:26.430 --> 18:32.390
I must say I am truly surprised that
your friend has been in Neotopia.

18:32.910 --> 18:37.540
And so he, too, is a shard caster?

18:37.540 --> 18:40.680
Could this be another twist of fate?

18:40.680 --> 18:42.480
Eh, Zico?

18:43.050 --> 18:45.020
I don't care about that!

18:45.020 --> 18:47.720
Just let me go to Neotopia now!

18:47.720 --> 18:50.490
Don't be in such a rush, hurrying won't help!

18:50.490 --> 18:55.800
The "visiting hours" in Neotopia
are very strictly defined.

18:55.800 --> 18:59.430
You have plenty of time to make it there, Zed.

19:14.410 --> 19:16.210
Why, you...

19:34.570 --> 19:35.840
We've got trouble!

19:35.840 --> 19:37.630
What is it?

19:41.410 --> 19:42.940
Roya?!

19:42.940 --> 19:44.480
Zed?

19:44.480 --> 19:46.450
Where are you going, Roya?

19:46.450 --> 19:47.650
Roya!

19:47.650 --> 19:48.820
Master Zico?

19:48.820 --> 19:51.780
Wait, Roya, you mustn't go!

19:53.390 --> 19:55.860
I'm sorry, Master Zico.

19:56.890 --> 19:59.020
Roya!

20:10.100 --> 20:11.540
Roya...

20:11.540 --> 20:13.670
Where did Roya go?

20:15.540 --> 20:17.340
You don't suppose she...

20:17.340 --> 20:18.610
Yes...

20:18.610 --> 20:21.150
I'm sure she went to Tusk.

20:21.150 --> 20:24.280
Tusk? What the heck's going on here?!

20:31.090 --> 20:34.960
This is my homeland.

20:34.960 --> 20:38.090
I no longer have anywhere to return to.

20:53.050 --> 20:56.680
I am really not in the mood for this right now.

21:14.400 --> 21:16.370
What the heck is the deal?!

21:17.400 --> 21:19.570
I'll tell you about Roya.

21:19.570 --> 21:24.530
The truth is I brought her back
from Tusk ten years ago.

21:26.380 --> 21:30.950
She most likely has noticed the appearance
of a horn on her shoulder,

21:30.950 --> 21:33.390
which is certain proof of her Tuskan heritage.

21:33.390 --> 21:36.850
So, Roya was a Tuskan all along?

21:44.560 --> 21:48.020
I won't be able to hold off so many of them!

21:56.980 --> 22:00.280
I'm done for.

22:20.770 --> 22:25.230
The whole, great lot of you surrounding
a frail, little girl, eh?

22:26.410 --> 22:29.200
This Tusk lives up to its reputation
as a land of savages.

22:41.920 --> 22:44.520
Open the hands you have over your face

22:44.520 --> 22:47.360
It looks like you'll be done in by the sun

22:47.360 --> 22:52.320
Let's let the sky melt away our melancholy

22:52.670 --> 22:58.310
We stripped off our heavy jackets
and started running, 6, 7, 8

22:58.310 --> 23:04.270
So, we'll make the wind blow in this
windless place, and take off! Go!

23:09.320 --> 23:14.720
I'm shaken awake, head spinning,
and sunlight hits me the next moment

23:14.720 --> 23:18.520
The rain's abatement lets loose dreams

23:20.230 --> 23:22.960
We'll dash down this path

23:22.960 --> 23:30.430
Search for the one-and-only "now"
and our heartbeats

23:31.100 --> 23:33.770
Thrust out our clasped hands

23:33.770 --> 23:36.540
It looks like we could even shatter the sun

23:36.540 --> 23:41.500
Let's launch our melancholy into the sky

23:42.020 --> 23:47.550
Try again, step forward, if we're hesitating 7, 8, 9

23:47.550 --> 23:53.690
We'll shout loud enough to echo
to Cloud Ten, and go!

24:17.120 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Maze of Memory

24:18.080 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Maze of Memory"
